<title>POLAND: Polish food prices rise 0.2 pct in January 21-31.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices rise 0.2 pct in January 21-31.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 0.2 percent in the January 21-31 period after rising 0.2 percent in the previous 10 days, and were 1.5 percent higher than in December 21-31, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>				  JAN 21-31   JAN 11-20    LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)     0.2	   0.2	    1.5</p>
<p> Bread			     0.4	   0.5	    1.7</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	 -0.1	   0.6	    3.5</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products     -0.1	   0.1	    0.1</p>
<p> Dairy products		  0.7	   0.2	    1.8</p>
<p> Eggs			     -0.3	  -0.2	    0.7</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
